{
  "credit": "Quaternius — Universal Animation Library + character packs",
  "license": "CC0 / see Quaternius' terms for the paid packs",
  "link": "https://quaternius.com",
  "note": "The UAL megafiles are build INPUTS, not deliverables — 20 MB each, of which three quarters is animation data any given app will not play. They are simply not in `publish`, so they never reach the CDN; the curated subset built into derived/ is the deliverable.\n\nCHARACTERS ARE SPLIT BY STYLE+GENDER, and that is a size decision, not a taste one. These are 2048-square PBR maps at 3-4 MB apiece, so the whole characters folder in one library is 67 MB — past Cloudflare's 25 MiB per-file limit. Splitting by style keeps it at 30 MB, still over. Style+gender lands at ~15 MB each because that is exactly how the textures are shared: one Normal/BaseColor/Roughness set per style+gender, plus the hair and eye maps every character uses. Those shared maps are therefore re-embedded in all six files, which is why the six total more than the single 67 MB file would. Nothing is resampled to achieve any of this; re-encoding the 2K PNGs would shrink it far more, and is a content decision nobody has made yet.",
  "library": [
    {
      "slug": "characters-regular-female",
      "from": [
        "characters"
      ],
      "include": [
        "Regular_Female_*"
      ],
      "categories": {
        "*_FullBody": "fullbody",
        "*_OnlyHead": "head",
        "*_UpperBody": "upperbody"
      }
    },
    {
